{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_st03","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_st03","title":"自新大陆","storyCode":"LE-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"a2ecceafc10ec4ee4cc8c2cb71965bf5458491b65cd1b33609872b8421a91750","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"事件在不同的人身上刻下不同的痕迹，但黑键还没有余力去理解它们，他还需要时间。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是全部了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"绝无一丝隐瞒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这种处理方式......倒也有些出乎意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办？不怎么办。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这件事本来就和你无关，现在不过是改了改对涉事领地的处置，能和你扯上任何关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您说得是。可这样一来，那些感染者得以继续在那个地块上生活，难保他们不乱说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？谁会相信一群感染者的胡言乱语？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我们接下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必着急，该做的事情还有很多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭谨的侍从","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......以上就是这次事件的最终报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个叫车尔尼的，他在这次事件中作的那首曲子，你们找来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭谨的侍从","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女皇之声随时可以采谱，几小时后就能为您演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，我听录音就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，我甚至能听见他作曲时发自心底的吼声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这人很有些才华，可惜，还不太够。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颓废的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还行，没加重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颓废的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板说，那次事件导致的感染加重很奇特，许多人的感染在那之后都进入了持续的稳定期，我也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会是像之前那样先好后坏吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颓废的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按行板的说法，他们彻底调查了这一现象，发现在事件中活性化的源石，几乎全部进入了持续的低活性状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颓废的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换句话说，我还能晃悠一阵子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，行板知道公爵大人打算拿夕照区怎么办吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颓废的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也是听说的，说是女皇之声要求公爵大人不能动夕照区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢天谢地！感谢女皇陛下的仁慈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颓废的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小点声！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，这以后的日子该怎么过啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颓废的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴吧，你还嫌事情不够大是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颓废的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后的日子？过一天算一天罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我还想多活两天呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颓废的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就更该把嘴闭严实了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，我现在算是理解了，有些事还是不知道比较轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等处理完这里的后续工作，我还是申请调动到其他地方好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者去本舰上看看，应该也不错......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g12_sewer"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了找你，我们也费了不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么想说的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你的人骗白垩来维谢海姆的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了音乐会的报酬之外，告诉他的全是真话，就为了把急着赚钱给我治病的他引到这个局里来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是他和你无冤无仇，你为什么这么做？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是听了内情，我就不能放你走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来也没几天好活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，看在我们俩共事过的分上，我告诉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特罗洛伯爵已经在找白垩了，而且快找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又怎样？白垩一直在我身边，也就等于一直在你的掌控之下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到过她的研究笔记，你应该知道，她对尘世之音的研究确实很令人惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在没拿到那些笔记之前，我只知道她对这东西研究很深，却不知道深到了什么程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我害怕的是，如果让她接着研究下去，她没准能用尘世之音干出些更恐怖的事来，比如在更远的距离引发和诱导共振。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一觉醒来，身边的好孙子变成了怪物，这就是你想要的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与其这样，还不如直接把白垩塞到她鼻子底下，让她觉得时不我待，在技术尚有瑕疵的时候推进计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，还有疑问吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果黑键他们没发现夕照厅里的扩音器，你怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还能怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕照区什么样，我就什么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没什么好问的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就跟我走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不杀我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了你既没必要，又伤感情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，去我的店里喝杯咖啡，我们一起聊一聊那两个愚蠢又可敬的年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能拒绝吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小炎熔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"谁让你逞能的？你要是出了什么意外，我一辈子都不会原谅你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你是说维谢海姆的事？我这不是好好的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁和一帮听信了谣言的人对峙，是谁明知道自己会受尘世之音影响还不撤离，是谁连法术都没怎么学过就和人以命相搏的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得我没给你讲过这些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找过车尔尼先生了！他告诉我的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......如果你想知道事情经过，直接来问我不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实是想问问那位在莱塔尼亚教过我钢琴的约翰老师的事，和车尔尼先生聊起来才知道，你差点——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"差点就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"——我警告你！下次再有这种事，你绝对不许逞能！你......你听见了吗，听见了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别哭啦，我这不是好好的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"可你的感染程度——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实因为尘世之音加深了不少，但已经控制住了，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，控制住也不行！你总是让我注意身体，可是到了自己身上，就什么都不管了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是......不在了，我、我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小炎熔，姐姐保证，一定会更加留心保护自己的，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你可不许骗我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢。博士给我批的假期还挺长的，我会好好利用这段时间休养一下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，你不是去问那位约翰老师的情况了吗？他怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生说，他一年前在一个交流会上见过约翰老师一次，约翰老师一切都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"这么一说，你好不容易去了一趟莱塔尼亚，连法杖都换成了笛子，难道你也在那儿学了音乐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最多也就是当法杖在用罢了，不会吹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"该不会，你其实在害羞吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么好害羞的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信！你吹来听听嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......我真的吹了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"难听死啦！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢您的关心，博士。我现在感觉很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我要再次感谢您对夕照区的保护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有您代表罗德岛去交涉，女皇之声是无论如何也不会为一个小小的夕照区发话的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这是我应该做的。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您客气了。"}]},{"label":"帮助感染者是罗德岛的宗旨。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如您所说，我最近更加深刻地感受到了这一点。"}]},{"label":"和黑键相比，夕照区的事算是容易的了。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您找我到这里来所为何事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您提交报告申请去前线，我来确认您的意向。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的想法已经完整地写在报告里了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"虽然您的病情目前稳定，但感染程度很深。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"战场上一切皆有可能。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有心理准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，在被芙蓉搀着去音乐厅的时候，我已经做好赴死的准备了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然出了这么多波折，事件的结果也和我天真的预想大相径庭，但我却......活下来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种感觉实在是有些奇妙，我却无法很好地表达出来，无论通过话语还是音乐都不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不奢求在战场上找到将其表达出来的方法，但我想，用一种完全不同的方式为感染者奋斗，也许对我更有好处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我明白您的心情。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不过，还请您安心等待审批的结果。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，黑键是在罗德岛上吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"当然。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"您为什么问这个？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从来到罗德岛的第二天开始，我就完全见不到他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我偶尔甚至会觉得，好像那个一身黑衣服的乌提卡伯爵真的死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"按照莱塔尼亚的官方口径，他确实已经死了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他活得好好的，给他一些时间吧。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"讽刺的是，这反倒助成了我们和莱塔尼亚的合作。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我先走了，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"说到黑键，我要做的下一件事，恰好和他相关。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您要见见他吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了。这件事对他的伤害之大，我甚至不敢说自己能理解，也只能想象了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等他什么时候愿意见我或芙蓉了，那时候再说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"再见。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"期待您在战斗之余创作出不输以往的音乐。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？亏你能找到我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这里很适合吹风。很减压。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没什么压力可减。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我无话可说？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"有干员在这儿见过你。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪位？我不介意和他聊聊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"言归正传，我来充当一回信使。这是你的信。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信？从哪儿寄来的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"莱塔尼亚。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道是什么了，把信给我吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"需要陪拆服务吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你还挺有趣的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"过奖。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很难想象你指挥作战的时候是什么样的......也像现在这样不正经？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"哈哈。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是你感到尴尬时的标准反应？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一个戴着兜帽、一言不发的人，啧啧啧，还挺恐怖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"我不介意在你出任务的时候更不正经一些。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那还挺让人期待的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我走了。继续享受独处时光吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用你说我也会的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......莱塔尼亚平民黑键的护照。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"白垩的......还有乌提卡伯爵的......死亡证明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？还有什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......信？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>亲爱的黑键先生：</i>\n<i>恭喜您获得了梦寐以求的自由。</i>\n<i>我们共同的敌人，那位乌提卡伯爵，已经逝去。</i>\n<i>对于他给您和您的朋友造成的伤害，我感到万分痛心。</i>\n<i>希望这封信，和随信附赠的文件，能稍微缓解您内心的痛苦。</i>\n<i>又及：请切实保证乌提卡伯爵的死亡。</i>\n<i>否则，我们合力构筑的一切都将付诸流水。</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没签名......匿名信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很符合我对她的印象。"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗德岛干员黑键把杖尖抵在信上，纸张燃烧起来。\n火苗很快蔓延到护照上，然后是乌提卡伯爵的死亡证明，然后是白垩的。\n纸张燃烧的味道在甲板上蔓延开来。\n黑键抱起立在一旁的大提琴。\n心中想着某位朋友拉琴时的样子，他闭着眼，奏出一段简单明快的旋律。\n双子女皇刚刚掌权时，莱塔尼亚涌现出无数歌功颂德的歌曲，这也是其中一首。\n时至今日，这首歌的后半段早已被人忘却，只有前半部分，因其明朗的旋律和直白抒发自己愉快心情的歌词，还在一些人口中传唱。\n夕阳刺眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i12"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>天空湛蓝晴朗，</i>\n<i>微风轻声歌唱；</i>\n<i>河水潺潺流淌，</i>\n<i>我的心充满......</i>\n<i>充满......</i>\n<i>希望。</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]}]}
